@startuml
' State diagram: a void request - Inventory & POS System v0.32.0 (report, Lecture 5-7; redrawn 2026-10-27)
' Edit: paste into draw.io (Arrange > Insert > Advanced > PlantUML) or planttext.com
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E6F1EE
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
  ParticipantBorderColor Black
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ActorBorderColor Black
  ActorBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  BorderColor #C9B458
}
skinparam swimlaneWidth same
hide circle

[*] --> Requested : cashier asks, with a reason\n(today's receipt only)
[*] --> Approved : admin taps Void now\n(own receipt screen)
Requested : waiting at the top of the Sales Report;\nthe receipt is unchanged
Requested --> Requested : code emailed to an admin\n(10 minutes, 5 tries)
Requested --> Approved : admin's password or the\nemailed code (receipt still from today)
Requested --> Rejected : admin rejects, with a note
Requested --> Rejected : day is over\n(only rejecting is allowed)
Approved : receipt marked VOIDED; stock back;\nslip names who asked and who approved
Rejected : nothing changed; a new request is allowed
Approved --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
note right of Approved
  Two admins approving at once:
  only one UPDATE finds "requested",
  the other is rolled back.
end note
@enduml
